Day 7 GitHub Report: Service Automation & Persistence
Objective
Transform the Babystore Analytics engine from a manual script into an automated Linux service to ensure 100% uptime and resilience.

Key Achievements

Service Implementation: Created a systemd service configuration (babystore.service) to manage the application lifecycle.

Automation: Enabled "auto-start" on system boot, ensuring the analytics engine is "immortal" and survives server restarts.

Recovery Logic: Configured Restart=always policies so the operating system automatically restarts the app in the event of a code crash.

Network Troubleshooting: Successfully identified and resolved a Security Group conflict that was blocking Port 5000 while maintaining SSH access.
